    {
      "id": "root_daily",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-10-06 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\n[omnigent-ai/omnigent](https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent) — 複数AIエージェントのハーネスを統合するオープンソースメタフレームワーク\n\n[出典リンク](https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/OpenAI|OpenAI]]\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/Apple|Apple]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/GPT|GPT]]\n- [[Technologies/diffusion|diffusion]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_ai_research",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -390,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 🔬 AI・LLM 研究\n\n収集件数: **3件**"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_research_ba23364c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[Learning to Read the Contextual Tokens in Diffusion Transformers](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.06844v1)**\n_Score: 19.1_"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_research_0fb808d9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[Direct Intermediate Initialization for Tilted Diffusion Samplers](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.06834v1)**\n_Score: 17.97_"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_research_33595fcc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[MemPilot: Orchestrating On-Demand Multimodal Memory Curation for LLM Agents](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.06830v1)**\n_Score: 17.97_"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_ai_dev_tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 🛠️ 開発ツール・IDE統合\n\n収集件数: **3件**"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_dev_tools_1ce3fc7f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -190,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ omnigent-ai/omnigent — Omnigent is an open-source AI agent framework and meta-harness: orchestrate Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Pi, and custom agents — swap harnesses without rewriting, enforce policies and sandboxing, and collaborate in real time from any device. (★50/day)](https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent)**\n_Score: 102_"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_dev_tools_93de4383",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ raullenchai/Rapid-MLX — Rapid-MLX is an open-source (Apache 2.0) OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible LLM inference server for Apple Silicon, built on MLX, focused on reliable tool calling for coding agents. Up to 4× faster than Apple's MLX (mlx-lm) on the same weights. (★16/day)](https://github.com/raullenchai/Rapid-MLX)**\n_Score: 48_"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_dev_tools_0769b325",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ 0x4m4/hexstrike-ai — HexStrike AI MCP Agents is an advanced MCP server that lets AI agents (Claude, GPT, Copilot, etc.) autonomously run 150+ cybersecurity tools for automated pentesting, vulnerability discovery, bug bounty automation, and security research. Seamlessly bridge LLMs with real-world offensive security capabilities. (★59/day)](https://github.com/0x4m4/hexstrike-ai)**\n_Score: 42_"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_business",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
